 character; she dislikes this characterization as well, strongly objecting whenever Daru mentions it."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6487"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7e4edc924ab8ff85b91090fb67baf4e80c868f20a12b10342c9ec7832819272b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a2cf60fe49f2e1fdeb1ccb63b3fa2d0e7ad6b6ab42df08b8f51368af1cc311b9.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6491","characterName":"椎名 まゆり","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6491"},"originalCharacterName":"椎名 まゆり","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"201"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mayuri is a long-time childhood friend of Okabe and a bit of an airhead. Mayuri enjoys creating cosplay costumes and has a part-time job at a maid cafe called \"Mayqueen Nyannyan\". She often calls herself Mayushii, a portmanteau of her given name and surname, which is also what Daru calls her. She has a distinctive sing-song way of speaking, and she typically sings \"tutturuu\" when she arrives or introduces herself."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6491"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/447d097631982ce19df23fdc1c181c939db5813867ea0e1c30da2dfc52f97da3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/332d8416e9c0960a701b75f1e3534644aa85fced47dfc549808c9e1d151029eb.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6492","characterName":"阿万音 鈴羽","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6492"},"originalCharacterName":"阿万音 鈴羽","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"927"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"51"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Amane Suzuha works part-time for the landlord of Rintarou's flat and is on a search for her father in Akihabara. She enjoys riding her bicycle and appears to be at odds with Kurisu."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is in fact a Time Traveller from 2036 who, using the guise of John Titor, seeks to prevent SERN from creating a Time Machine that will lead to dystopia. Though she is unaware of it, she is the daughter of Hashida Itaru."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6492"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/212f17722ef9f8fff151cc5e087decade15b2590d049cc6a93fef432064d8e82.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0dd233f3977b0ac867a5385cd21673b41050df6b8f646160f42fbad8a1ef7a7c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6493","characterName":"橋田 至","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6493"},"originalCharacterName":"橋田 至","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"19"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"519"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"98"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Daru is an experienced hacker who has known Okabe since high school. He is very skilled at computer programming and with old and new computer hardware. He is also well-versed in things pertaining to otaku culture. Okabe and Shiina refer to him by the nickname \"Daru\", a portmanteau of his given name and surname. Okabe sometimes also calls him Super Haker, mispronouncing the word \"hacker\" to his chagrin. He is a big fan of Faris and he frequently says things which could be taken as sexual harassment. Daru is often annoyed with Okabe's frequent delusional behavior."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6493"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/13173dbd8fff491548aed0e1bce7f44f3dc95fb64b6fed97a1b63bba262932a8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/33edb87aed90a05596e96e764e1f6c2b783d1a38b3f1054ceedcbc1b25188ad4.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6494","characterName":"秋葉 留未穂","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6494"},"originalCharacterName":"秋葉 留未穂","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"403"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"143"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"77"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"54"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"43"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Faris Nyannyan works at the maid cafe \"Mayqueen Nyannyan\", the same maid cafe that Shiina works at, and is the most popular waitress there. Her real name is Akiha Rumiho, whose family owns Akihabara, her being the one suggested it become the city of moe and anime. She tends to add \"nyan\" to her sentences."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6494"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9a3200de5197105740724641bc256396ed7642d1771bb9dea8756b56c8bf27ec.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/2375bdb4e0e65035844c9ce874062eb188e1bb56442261f49d351abc31e44371.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6495","characterName":"天王寺 裕吾","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6495"},"originalCharacterName":"天王寺 裕吾","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"32"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"312"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"187"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is Okabe's landlord, who owns a TV repair store beneath his apartment, living with his daughter, Nae. Okabe often gives him the nickname \"Mr. Braun\" for his passion to Braun tube TV."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"After seeing a gel-i-fied human in the sewers he was residing in, he was recruited by SERN, which provided the money he needed to get out of the slums. After a while SERN ordered him to go to Akihabara in Japan. It was here that he met Suzuha Hashida, his neighbour, and Tsuzuri Imamiya, his future wife."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Sometime prior to the first D-Mail, Tennouji recruited Moeka Kiryuu into the Rounders and communicated with her as \"FB\". It was only until Rintarou and Moeka discovers his identity was FB revealed to be a man, as FB introduced themselves as a woman to all Rounders recruits."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6495"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/08bdd943310fa72349392b2144aa322f94b28bd79fc509015fc578c2f072d4a3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8d/8dbcd912ea885cf7e9688474c407adb3ded7f1bf9f9e34010d78c4da60eb238b.webp","width":256,"height":224,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6496","characterName":"桐生 萌郁","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6496"},"originalCharacterName":"桐生 萌郁","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"606"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"167"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Moeka is a part-time editor whom Rintarou encounters in Akiba. She is practically glued to her phone and cannot function without it. Even when face to face, Moeka prefers to communicate by email."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is searching for the legendary retro PC known as the IBN 5100."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steins;Gate Official Site"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Moeka was a constantly bullied social outcast; she desperately tried to make friends and find a place to belong, but failed miserably due to her social paranoia. In 2004, she fell into a deep depression due to hating everything and being hopeless, thinking that she no longer had a reason to live, Moeka decided to suicide. She drank several sleeping pills, hoping that she would die, but to no avail. As the pills were not working, her final attempt was to jump off a large building. At that moment, she received a mail from the enigmatic FB recruiting her to the Rounders, a SERN unit, changing her life forever. As FB often communicated with Moeka and acted as a mother figure towards her, speaking with Moeka about her problems and comforting her, she came to see FB as the person that gave her life meaning and devoted every waking moment to sending mails to them and carrying out their given orders, developing a dependency on FB and their mails. When that relationship which meant life to Moeka required her to kill someone, she killed. By taking another’s life, her life retained meaning. While Moeka is capable of carrying out atrocities for acceptance, she strives to be loved and has the potential to be a good person if led in the right direction."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6496"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/be/be779ffe977e86cadbe562d22ad30593080e3bdec13e8a8cd2203687a131d37c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/73/73ee2a54ec2625f17cc3ba4dff32895fc4f915b3fda532c92ec0528a342d7741.webp","width":256,"height":245,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6497","characterName":"漆原 るか","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6497"},"originalCharacterName":"漆原 るか","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"830"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"73"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"77"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"44"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ruka is a friend of Okabe. His appearance is that of a female and he acts in a feminine way due to his upbringing, wearing girl's clothing within and outside his father's temple. He is also a close friend and classmate of Mayuri's and is often asked to try on her cosplay costumes, but as he is quite shy, he generally refuses. He is unsure of his feelings towards Okabe, who calls him by his nickname, Rukako, containing the feminine suffix -ko, to denote his feminine appearance, and thinks of Ruka as his pupil."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6497"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/6006510cae54417924d15a08813331a7f65225cee3eae807f448b1612d23ea49.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/74ab5b9d60383a38142af3ae0dcec94886d3e286c2891c8662e5744dbdc6fc74.webp","width":238,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6498","characterName":"岡部 倫太郎","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6498"},"originalCharacterName":"岡部 倫太郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1214"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"177"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rintarou is an eccentric individual, a self-proclaimed mad scientist and often refers to himself under the alias of Hououin Kyouma, which is also the name he uses to introduce himself to other people. Mayuri and Daru refer to him by the nickname Okarin, a portmanteau of his surname and given name. He is the founder of what he calls the \"Future Gadget Laboratory\" in Akihabara where he spends most of his time. Rintarou gives off the appearance of being delusional and paranoid, frequently referring to the \"organization\" that is after him, talking to himself on his phone, and engaging in fits of maniacal laughter. Most of the time he takes on a fairly arrogant personality. He is usually seen wearing a lab coat."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"As he experiments with time travel, he learns that he is the only one who possesses the ability to determine changes between different timelines, which he dubs \"Reading Steiner\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The character is 18 years old and a first year student at Tokyo Denki University."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Modified from Wikipedia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6498"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe7479c493ca5f92c3d7b74d2b76acf2736322e9d0e38bf0d58e40b1436c4f81.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/40/405a988d84b865aff4327ebe6268342e1ee467fe73a4d9b6ce9d0e1765442a0c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p2798","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:3384","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2798","name":"GigasDrop.","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:15958:3384","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p17525","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p17525","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p17525","name":"Sovam","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:116961:v9887","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p25186","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p25186","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p25186","name":"Vasisualy","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:116962:v9887","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p6716","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p6716","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p6716","name":"Committee of Zero","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:150978:v9887","source":